"notes": [
{
"book": 2,
"row": 133,
"sec": 5,
"append": true,
"md": "- **Original limit:** Art. 334 first fixed SC/ST seat reservation for **10 years** (till 1960); later amendments extended it."
},
{
"book": 2,
"row": 133,
"sec": 0,
"append": true,
"md": "- **Part XVI (Arts. 330-342):** special provisions relating to certain classes (SCs, STs, Anglo-Indians, backward classes). Part XV = Elections; Part XVII = Official Language."
},
{
"book": 2,
"row": 134,
"sec": 0,
"append": true,
"md": "- **Why the PoA Act:** the PCR Act proved inadequate to check atrocities against SCs/STs, so Parliament enacted the PoA Act in 1989."
},
{
"book": 2,
"row": 134,
"sec": 4,
"append": true,
"md": "- **In force:** the PoA Amendment Act 2015 came into force in **2016** (26 January 2016)."
}
],
